            "link_label_de": "Produkt ansehen",
            "eyebrow_en": "IQ training equipment",
            "heading_en": "Attach. Position. Reward.",
            "body_en": "<p>Attach the adapter to a suitable toy using cable ties and combine it with a compatible magnetic system, such as Top-Matic. Normal is intended for scent work and detection; Extra for larger toys and dynamic training.</p>",
